  "subject": {
    "id": "domain-history-profile-runtime",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Bind the executable domain-history profile contract and public compiler surface.",
  "why": "P6 makes the adopter's history model an explicit, immutable input instead of hidden runtime convention. The shipped profiles, parser, document adapter, population compiler, and tests now agree on genesis, time, change, ontology-role, projection, and grounding semantics. This records only the executable and conformance surface, including package inclusion, and adds no mandatory universal profile, Event population, mapping DSL, or stable wire claim."
